{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21813","headline":"有酒十章 七 · 元稹","name":"有酒十章 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有酒有酒方烂漫，饮酣拔劒心眼乱。\n声若雷砰目流电，醉舞翻环身眩转。\n乾纲倒轧坤维旋，白日横空星宿见，一夫心醉万物变。\n何况蚩尤之蹴蹋，安得不以熊罴战。\n呜呼！风后力牧得亲见，我可奈何兮又进一杯除健羡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}